				<xs:documentation>The moment at which the element expressions are evaluated. This could be useful, for example, when we want to have on the first page the total number of pages: the total number of pages is known only after filling the entire report, so the text field that displays it at the beginning of the report should be evaluated only when reaching the end of the report.</xs:documentation>
			</xs:annotation>
		</xs:attribute>
		<xs:attribute name="fontName" type="xs:string">
			<xs:annotation>
